{"seq":2,"slug":"proteomics","title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 蛋白质组学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/protein-science/proteomics","wordCount":1293,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-分子生物学-蛋白质组学\">研究生 分子生物学 — 蛋白质组学</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>蛋白质组学是在全基因组水平上系统研究蛋白质表达、修饰、相互作用和功能的学科。与基因组相比，蛋白质组的复杂性高出数个量级——选择性剪接、翻译后修饰和蛋白质动态变化使得蛋白质组成为真正反映细胞功能状态的&quot;活地图&quot;。质谱技术是蛋白质组学的核心工具，定量蛋白质组学和蛋白质相互作用组学是两大主要方向。</p>\n<p>核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>质谱分析</strong>：通过质荷比（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m/z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>）鉴定蛋白质和肽段</li>\n<li><strong>自底向上策略（Bottom-up）</strong>：蛋白质酶解 → 肽段分析 → 蛋白质推断</li>\n<li><strong>自顶向下策略（Top-down）</strong>：直接分析完整蛋白质</li>\n<li><strong>定量蛋白质组学</strong>：TMT/iTRAQ 标记、SILAC、Label-free</li>\n<li><strong>蛋白质相互作用组</strong>：AP-MS、BioID/TurboID、交联质谱（XL-MS）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"质谱技术基础\">质谱技术基础</h3><p>质谱仪的三个核心组件：离子源 → 质量分析器 → 检测器。</p>\n<p><strong>电喷雾电离（ESI）</strong>：将溶液中的蛋白质/肽段电离为气相多电荷离子。与液相色谱（LC）直接联用。</p>\n<p><strong>基质辅助激光解吸电离（MALDI）</strong>：样品与基质共结晶，激光脉冲使其解吸电离。产生单电荷离子，适合高通量筛选。</p>\n<p><strong>串联质谱（MS/MS）</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>信息</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MS1</td>\n<td>测定前体离子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m/z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>肽段质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碎裂</td>\n<td>CID/HCD/ETD</td>\n<td>产生片段离子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MS2</td>\n<td>测定碎片离子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m/z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>氨基酸序列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>数据库搜索</strong>：将实验 MS/MS 谱图与蛋白质数据库中理论肽段谱图比对，实现肽段和蛋白质鉴定（工具：MaxQuant、Mascot、Proteome Discoverer）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"定量蛋白质组学\">定量蛋白质组学</h3><p><strong>标记定量法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SILAC（Stable Isotope Labeling by Amino acids in Cell culture）</strong>：细胞在含重同位素氨基酸（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>13</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{13}C_6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9641em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">13</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-Lys）的培养基中培养，MS1 级别比较轻重肽段的峰面积比</li>\n<li><strong>TMT/iTRAQ</strong>：化学标记法，可同时比较多达 18 个样品</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>无标记定量（Label-free quantification, LFQ）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于 MS1 离子强度（峰面积/峰强度）</li>\n<li>基于谱图计数（spectral counting）</li>\n<li>优点：无需标记，成本低；缺点：重复性要求高</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>数据非依赖采集（DIA）</strong>：如 SWATH-MS，对所有离子进行系统碎裂，提高覆盖度和定量精度。近年 DIA 方法日趋成熟，单次 LC-MS/MS 运行可鉴定和定量超过 10,000 个蛋白质。</p>\n<h3 id=\"翻译后修饰蛋白质组学\">翻译后修饰蛋白质组学</h3><p><strong>磷酸化蛋白质组学</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>富集：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>TiO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TiO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TiO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、IMAC</li>\n<li>一次实验可鉴定 &gt;40,000 个磷酸化位点</li>\n<li>激酶-底物关系推断</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>泛素化蛋白质组学</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>胰蛋白酶消化后泛素化 Lys 产生特征性 diGly（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>-GG）标签</li>\n<li>抗体富集 diGly 肽段</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>糖基化蛋白质组学</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>凝集素富集或亲水相互作用色谱（HILIC）</li>\n<li>糖链结构解析需要专门的碎裂方法（如 EThcD）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"蛋白质相互作用组学\">蛋白质相互作用组学</h3><p><strong>亲和纯化质谱（AP-MS）</strong>：用标签蛋白（bait）拉下互作蛋白（prey），MS 鉴定。</p>\n<p><strong>邻近标记（BioID/TurboID）</strong>：将生物素连接酶融合到目标蛋白，标记邻近蛋白。优势：可捕捉瞬时和弱相互作用。</p>\n<p><strong>交联质谱（XL-MS）</strong>：化学交联固定蛋白质间/内的空间邻近关系，MS 鉴定交联肽段对。提供距离约束信息，辅助结构建模。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单细胞蛋白质组学\">单细胞蛋白质组学</h3><p>传统蛋白质组学需要大量细胞（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），无法解析细胞异质性。近年进展：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SCoPE-MS</strong>（Single Cell Proteomics by Mass Spectrometry）</li>\n<li><strong>nanoPOTS</strong>（Nanodroplet Processing in One pot for Trace Samples）</li>\n<li>单细胞水平可鉴定 &gt;1,000 个蛋白质</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>解释为什么 bottom-up 蛋白质组学中存在&quot;蛋白质推断问题&quot;（protein inference problem）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较 TMT 标记定量和 Label-free 定量的优缺点。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个实验方案来鉴定某个激酶在特定刺激下的磷酸化底物。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论单细胞蛋白质组学面临的主要技术挑战。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>蛋白质组学数据的多重检验校正（如 FDR 控制在 1%）为什么如此重要？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Aebersold &amp; Mann (2016) &quot;Mass-spectrometric exploration of proteome structure and function&quot; 是质谱蛋白质组学的里程碑综述。</li>\n<li>Steen &amp; Mann (2004) &quot;The ABC&#39;s (and XYZ&#39;s) of peptide sequencing&quot; 是理解质谱原理的优秀入门。</li>\n<li>Slavov (2022) &quot;Unpicking the proteome in single cells&quot; 综述了单细胞蛋白质组学的最新进展。</li>\n<li>UniProt 和 ProteomeXchange 是蛋白质组学数据的主要公共资源。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>蛋白质组学以质谱为核心技术，实现了蛋白质的大规模鉴定和定量。从 bottom-up 策略到 DIA 方法的发展使覆盖深度和定量精度不断提升。翻译后修饰蛋白质组学揭示了蛋白质功能调控的动态图谱，相互作用组学则构建了细胞内蛋白质网络的全景。单细胞蛋白质组学正在成为下一个前沿，有望在肿瘤异质性、免疫应答和发育生物学中发挥关键作用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 分子生物学 — 蛋白质组学","id":"研究生-分子生物学-蛋白质组学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"质谱技术基础","id":"质谱技术基础"},{"level":3,"text":"定量蛋白质组学","id":"定量蛋白质组学"},{"level":3,"text":"翻译后修饰蛋白质组学","id":"翻译后修饰蛋白质组学"},{"level":3,"text":"蛋白质相互作用组学","id":"蛋白质相互作用组学"},{"level":3,"text":"单细胞蛋白质组学","id":"单细胞蛋白质组学"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 蛋白质结构与功能","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/protein-science/protein-structure-function"},"next":{"title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 蛋白质工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/protein-science/protein-engineering"}}